Scipion plugin for BioMetAll
============================

BioMetAll predicts metal-binding sites in proteins from backbone
preorganization geometry.

Reference: Sanchez-Aparicio et al., JCIM 2021.
DOI: 10.1021/acs.jcim.0c00827
